==Battleground==
*7 [[Mistress Celeboodle]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 40~43.33 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,300f</sup>.
*1 [[Scissoroo]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Mecha-Bun (Enemy)|Mecha-Bun]] spawns as the boss after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Scissoroo]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*4 [[Scissoroo]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 60~63.33 seconds<sup>1,800f~1,900f</sup>.
*3 [[Prof. Owlbrowley]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 80~83.33 seconds<sup>2,400f~2,500f</sup>.
*12 [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Mecha Bun makes a surprise reappearance in this stage, skipping Musashi in the process for some reason. Here, Mecha Bun spawns on a timer supported with a couple of Scissoroos, Prof. Owlbrowleys and Pigeon de Sables. Just like any other appearance Mecha Bun has had, he can easily be neutralized with crowd control units like [[Necro-Dancer Cat|Necro-Dancer]] and [[Sanzo Cat]], and units like [[Bubble Cat]] or [[Housewife Cat|Housewife]] can chip both Mecha Bun and the Owlbrowleys in the back, though be mindful of the Pigeon waves or pushing into Owlbrowleys too aggressively. Lastly, [[Carpenter Cat (Rare Cat)|Carpenter Cat]] can stall the boss, and various Mythic cats such as [[Master of Life Dr. Nova (Special Cat)|Master of Life Dr. Nova]] can be thrown in to speed up the fight or deal with the Scissoroos.

==='''Strategy 1 (Cheese)'''===
