'''Battle:''' Send out Fishman Cat the moment you have the chance, then immediately follow that up with Jelly Dumpling Cat. Fishman will hit Mistress Celeboodle, getting her to a range where a single Bullet Train Cat finishes the job. With the wealthy sum acquired from Mistress Celeboodle, send out Awakened Bahamut Cat, who will hit Scissoroo and stagger her. Jelly Dumpling Cat should reach the enemy base by this point; he will attack it and create a [[Wave Attack]] that staggers Scissoroo again. Bahamut can now safely finish his backswing animation and deliver the killing blow with his [[Explosion]], so you can use the subsequent cash to spawn Idi:N2. Just spam your fast units off cooldown and the stage is as good as beaten.

==Trivia==
*A Barrier Great is a reference to the [[wikipedia:Great Barrier Reef|Great Barrier Reef]], a coral reef system located on the coast of Queensland, Australia.

